<p>The May 20, 2026 cutoff of pre-2012 Kindles from the Kindle Store is a major event for anyone who owns one of these devices. While it is frustrating, it is also an opportunity to move your ebook library to an open, future-proof standard.</p>

<p><strong>Your action plan:</strong></p>
<ul>
  <li>Connect your old Kindle to a computer and copy the documents folder immediately</li>
